==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[hit]] [[on]]|hits on|hitting on|hit on}}

# {{context|transitive|idiomatic|lang=en}} To [[flirt]] with; to [[approach]] and speak to (someone), seeking [[romance]], [[love]], [[sex]], etc.
#: ''That's the third guy that has '''hit on''' her tonight.''
#: ''Guys are '''hitting on''' them almost all the time.''
# {{context|transitive|idiomatic|lang=en}} To [[discover]], [[pinpoint]]; to think up; to [[realize]]; to [[invent]].
#: ''He '''hit on''' a great idea for improving the design.''

